		(descr "Hirose DF40TC(4.0)-30DS-0.4V(51), HRS CL0684-4256-0-51. 30-pos 0.4mm pitch double-row RECEPTACLE, 4.0mm stack height, no retention tab. Mates with DF40TC-30DP-0.4V(51). Land pattern from DF40 catalog p.10 DF40HC (No Retention Tab): P=0.4, B=5.60, pad 0.2 wide, rows 3.78 outer / 2.38 inner -> 0.70 long at y=+-1.54. Body A=8.6 x 3.38, 3.90 above board. PIN 1 IS AT +X: mirrored in X relative to the plug because the boards mate face to face. NO G pads: TC has no retention tabs.")
